   ADDITIONAL NOTICE — SCOPE OF ACCEPTABLE USE

   CHAINBREAK is a defensive security measurement tool. It is intended for use
   only against cloud accounts and identities that the operator owns or is
   explicitly authorized to test. Use against third-party infrastructure
   without authorization is outside the intended use of this software and is
   likely unlawful in most jurisdictions. See SECURITY.md.
